    "caption": "Terminal 2, before security",
    "caption_hidden": true,
    "body": "<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Venue</th><th scope=\"col\">Open</th><th scope=\"col\">What it serves</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Northlight Coffee</th><td>04:00–22:00</td><td>Coffee, porridge and toasties next to check-in zone D.</td></tr>\n</tbody>"
   }
  },
  {
